{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OpsCam is a team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-range environments. Join other players in thrilling PvP battles and coordinate with your team to defeat the opposing team.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customization system allows you to tailor your weapon to suit your needs. Modify sights, grips, barrels, and accessories to achieve optimal performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it out and have fun!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3088080?t=1756421778","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/a91f35331a9ebcafa2620eec1d8e231356acedae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756421778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/f6f150650b3c3e25702cc69c225d38464c6b962e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756421778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/f6f150650b3c3e25702cc69c225d38464c6b962e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756421778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"O jogo cont\u00e9m representa\u00e7\u00f5es de viol\u00eancia moderada/intensa, incluindo combates armados, gritos agonizantes de dor. N\u00e3o h\u00e1 representa\u00e7\u00f5es de atos sexuais, agress\u00e3o sexual ou sexo n\u00e3o consensual. O jogo tamb\u00e9m n\u00e3o aborda temas como abuso de drogas, \u00e1lcool ou autoflagela\u00e7\u00e3o. Recomendado para jogadores maiores de de 17, devido \u00e0 natureza do conte\u00fado.\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OpsCam is a team-based multiplayer game. Players engage in fast-paced combat in close-range environments. Join other players in thrilling PvP battles and coordinate with your team to defeat the opposing team.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The customization system allows you to tailor your weapon to suit your needs. Modify sights, grips, barrels, and accessories to achieve optimal performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try it out and have fun!</p>","developers":["LAC Games BR"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088080/2730510873301100b3c10595afbb4a834e66c4ed/header.jpg?t=1756421778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257190421,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190421/movie480.mp4?t=1756421776","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190421/movie_max.mp4?t=1756421776"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190421/dcb2d14d550d8caad27bec5748e4133dd85efa1e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756421776","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190421/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756421776","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257190421/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756421776"}}],"name":"OpsCam","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or i3-7100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1650 or RX580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"},"plat